  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_first_00",
      "hash64": "F507D98D230335BB",
      "text": "Élèves de l’Institut Myrtille !\\nQuel plaisir de vous rencontrer ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_first_01",
      "hash64": "F507D88D23033408",
      "text": "My name is Salvio ! Je m’appelle Salvio !\\nEnchanté ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "0C2C03551D33AAF5",
      "text": "Oh, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] !\\nQuelle agréable surprise ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "0C2C02551D33A942",
      "text": "Tu sembles bien te plaire dans cette belle région\\nd’Unys. C’est formidable ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "0C2C01551D33A78F",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, Unys et Paldea partagent la même\\nlangue, mais pas tout à fait la même culture !\\c\\nJ’espère que mes cours t’ont aidé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à surmonter\\nles chocs culturels en arrivant ici ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 184,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "CEF387701EB49091",
      "text": "Absolument !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "CEF384701EB48B78",
      "text": "Hmmm...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "0C2C00551D33A5DC",
      "text": "Vraiment ? Oh, voilà qui fait très plaisir\\nà entendre ! I’m so happy ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "E26A4EA09EC2A1DA",
      "text": "Oh... Voilà qui est bien triste... Je m’efforce\\npourtant de donner des cours aussi enrichissants\\r\\nque possible pour mes élèves...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "0C2BFF551D33A429",
      "text": "Je ferai en sorte que mes cours à l’Institut Myrtille\\nsoient profitables à tout le monde ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "0C2BFE551D33A276",
      "text": "I’ll do my best ! Je vais faire de mon mieux,\\net j’espère que toi aussi, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "3A95016D2A285162",
      "text": "Merci de m’avoir invité ici à nouveau !\\nThank you so much ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "3A95026D2A285315",
      "text": "Voyager ainsi d’une région à l’autre me rappelle\\nbien des souvenirs ! So nostalgic ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "D5B856845D611BF4",
      "text": "Vous êtes déjà venu ici ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "D5B859845D61210D",
      "text": "Vous avez beaucoup voyagé ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "3A94FF6D2A284DFC",
      "text": "Une excellente question, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] !\\nJe vais me faire un plaisir de répondre ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "3A95006D2A284FAF",
      "text": "Sache que j’étais un grand voyageur, dans\\nma jeunesse ! I was a real globe-trotter ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "3A94FD6D2A284A96",
      "text": "J’ai parcouru le monde entier avec mon sac à dos,\\nen quête de nouveaux paysages à admirer ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "3A94FE6D2A284C49",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, j’ai une question pour toi ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "3A94FB6D2A284730",
      "text": "Quelle était la vue la plus époustouflante\\nque j’aie eu la chance de voir au cours de\\r\\nmes voyages ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "D5B858845D611F5A",
      "text": "Les montagnes !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "D5B853845D6116DB",
      "text": "La mer !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_05",
      "hash64": "D5B852845D611528",
      "text": "Le désert !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_06",
      "hash64": "D5B855845D611A41",
      "text": "Le paysage urbain !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "3A94FC6D2A2848E3",
      "text": "Eh non ! Wrong answer ! Mais peut-être que\\nla question était un peu trop difficile.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "3A95096D2A285EFA",
      "text": "La vue la plus époustouflante qu’il m’ait été\\ndonné de voir... est le visage d’une femme.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_09",
      "hash64": "3A950A6D2A2860AD",
      "text": "La femme qui allait devenir mon épouse !\\nMy wife ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_10",
      "hash64": "3A98876D2A2B6AEB",
      "text": "N’était-ce pas une belle histoire ?\\nJ’espère qu’elle t’a plu ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "8FDEB7631B1C0D53",
      "text": "My dear [VAR 0x0100(0000)] !\\nJ’espère que tu te portes bien ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "8FDEB6631B1C0BA0",
      "text": "Les élèves de cet institut ont une passion\\ndébordante pour les études ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "8FDEB9631B1C10B9",
      "text": "Ces jeunes gens désirent devenir des Dresseurs\\nou des Dresseuses à l’échelle internationale,\\r\\net ont conscience de l’utilité des langues pour\\r\\naccomplir cet objectif ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 171,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "8FDEB8631B1C0F06",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, avoir un but concret est le meilleur\\nmoyen de conserver sa motivation intacte tout\\r\\nau long de son apprentissage.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "8FDEBB631B1C141F",
      "text": "Et toi, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ? Est-ce que tu as un but\\nque tu souhaites atteindre dans la vie ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "2BE9B72B1C4ED5FF",
      "text": "Oui, et pas qu’un seul !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "2BE9B82B1C4ED7B2",
      "text": "Non, pas encore...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "8FDEBA631B1C126C",
      "text": "Vraiment ? C’est super ! How nice !\\nJe te souhaite d’accomplir tous tes rêves ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "9388C46710B2ADCA",
      "text": "And it’s okay ! Chacun avance dans la vie\\nà son propre rythme. Rien ne sert de courir ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
